If your storage supports ReadWriteMany (RWX), such as:

NFS
CephFS
EFS (AWS)
Azure Files
Some Longhorn configurations
Some NetApp systems
then multiple PVCs in different namespaces can point to the same underlying storage export/share.


Cross-namespace networking: Yes, use Services.
Cross-namespace access to the same PVC: No.
Cross-namespace access to the same underlying files: Yes, typically via NFS, CephFS, EFS, Azure Files, or another RWX-capable shared filesystem.


